# Upstream folders this fork does not track at all: no file under them is in git.
# The host project vendors xLua under its Assets/ folder, so Unity imports these
# directories and writes one .meta per folder and per file. Ignoring the folder
# and its .meta together keeps a fresh clone clean. Nothing outside this repo
# references them by GUID.
/General
/General.meta
/Test
/Test.meta
/Tools
/Tools.meta
/WebGLPlugins
/WebGLPlugins.meta
/build
/build.meta
/docs
/docs.meta

